Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Summer, 1898.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.86,0:00:03.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}You are a volunteer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.18,0:00:05.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Weeks ago you had another life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.24,0:00:08.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Now you are standing in a field of white tents, in a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.68,0:00:10.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}camp that is already full.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:01.25,0:00:07.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1253 0 l 1253 132 l 0 132{\p0}
