Dialogue: 3,0:00:01.25,0:00:07.00,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}REGIMENTS IN CAMP AT BAY DISTRICT · SAN FRANCISCO, 1898
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.85,0:00:12.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}You came to fight Spain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.27,0:00:13.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}You have a rifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.28,0:00:16.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}But the enemy that is coming for you is not in Cuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.36,0:00:18.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It is already inside the camp.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:11.10,0:00:16.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1596 0 l 1596 132 l 0 132{\p0}
