Dialogue: 3,0:00:11.10,0:00:16.85,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}SECOND MASSACHUSETTS VOLUNTEERS WAITING TO GO ABOARD · PORT TAMPA, 1898
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:19.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It is in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.61,0:00:20.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It is on the flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:22.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It is on the hands of the men around you.
