Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:41.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The general commanding the Fifth Army Corps, William
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.09,0:00:44.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Shafter, said that disease was a thousand times
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.06,0:00:47.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}harder to stand up against than the missiles of the enemy.
