Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.66,0:01:23.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In the World War I, 63,114 other deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.07,0:01:25.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}53,402 in battle.
