Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.82,0:01:28.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And camps like these would fill again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.40,0:01:31.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Twenty years later, draftees would arrive at a camp
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:34.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}in Ohio, to be examined, inoculated, and fed.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:26.07,0:01:31.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1038 0 l 1038 132 l 0 132{\p0}
