Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.30,0:02:18.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In 1898, the United States went to war with Spain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.64,0:02:22.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Volunteer regiments poured toward the camps and the ports.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:15.55,0:02:21.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1917 0 l 1917 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:02:15.55,0:02:21.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:02:15.55,0:02:21.30,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}PHOTO · HARPER'S PICTORIAL HISTORY OF THE WAR WITH SPAIN (1899)
Dialogue: 3,0:02:15.55,0:02:21.30,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}SEVENTY-FIRST NEW YORK VOLUNTEERS GOING ABOARD TRANSPORT VIGILANCIA · PORT TAMPA, 1898
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.13,0:02:36.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Typhoid is a bacterial infection that spreads
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.97,0:02:39.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}through contaminated food or water.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.17,0:02:42.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A camp of tens of thousands of men, with latrines
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.26,0:02:45.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}and kitchens and flies, gave it everything it needed.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:34.38,0:02:40.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1639 0 l 1639 132 l 0 132{\p0}
