Dialogue: 3,0:03:11.68,0:03:17.43,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARMY TRAINING CARTOON · 1944
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.63,0:03:36.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The result ran to nearly 3,000 manuscript pages,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.16,0:03:37.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}with 100 maps and charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.00,0:03:40.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Many of them were plans of camps.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.43,0:03:41.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Each box a tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.61,0:03:42.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Each mark a case.
