Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.53,0:04:52.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And typhoid was not the only danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.28,0:04:55.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In the campaign in Cuba, PBS says more than 2,000
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.01,0:04:58.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}troops caught yellow fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.07,0:04:59.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}That story comes later.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:49.78,0:04:55.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1079 0 l 1079 132 l 0 132{\p0}
