Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.84,0:05:12.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And the Army learned a second lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.50,0:05:16.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In 1909, it offered typhoid vaccination to volunteers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.38,0:05:18.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In 1911, it required it.
