Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.38,0:05:50.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}By the World War I, the Army counted 1,529 primary
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.10,0:05:51.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}typhoid admissions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.51,0:05:55.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In the Spanish–American War, the yearly typhoid rate
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.37,0:05:59.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}had been more than 300 times higher per thousand men.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:46.63,0:05:52.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1038 0 l 1038 132 l 0 132{\p0}
