Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.76,0:06:02.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The full story of that vaccine comes later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.74,0:06:05.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}But the idea behind it was not new.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.16,0:06:08.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A general had faced the same choice, more than a
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.49,0:06:09.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}century before.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:00.01,0:06:05.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1038 0 l 1038 132 l 0 132{\p0}
