Dialogue: 3,0:06:00.01,0:06:05.76,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}U.S. ARMY CAMP · CAMP SHERMAN, OHIO · 1917–18
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.67,0:06:18.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The Continental Army had an enemy that no musket
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.88,0:06:20.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}could stop. Smallpox.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.29,0:06:23.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}About 3 in 10 soldiers who caught it died.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:15.92,0:06:21.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1660 0 l 1660 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:06:15.92,0:06:21.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:06:15.92,0:06:21.67,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}PRINT · PUBLIC DOMAIN
Dialogue: 3,0:06:15.92,0:06:21.67,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}WASHINGTON TAKING COMMAND OF THE AMERICAN ARMY AT CAMBRIDGE · 1775 (PRINT)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.17,0:06:41.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In February 1776, General Arnold banned soldiers
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.18,0:06:43.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}from inoculating themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.52,0:06:47.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In Canada, General John Thomas refused inoculation,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.78,0:06:50.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}caught smallpox, and died that year.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:37.42,0:06:43.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1467 0 l 1467 132 l 0 132{\p0}
