Dialogue: 3,0:06:37.42,0:06:43.17,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}GEORGE WASHINGTON · WILLIAMSTOWN PORTRAIT BY GILBERT STUART, 1803
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.31,0:07:05.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It worked, but it was dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.95,0:07:07.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In Boston in 1721, Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.75,0:07:12.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Boylston estimated that natural smallpox killed 14%,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.03,0:07:13.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}and inoculation two.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:03.56,0:07:09.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1489 0 l 1489 132 l 0 132{\p0}
