Dialogue: 3,0:07:03.56,0:07:09.31,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}INOCULATION OF THE SMALL POX AS PRACTISED IN BOSTON · LETTER, 1722
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.05,0:07:22.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Even so, inoculation carried a risk of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.21,0:07:25.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The National Library of Medicine calls Washington's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.78,0:07:27.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}decision bold and dangerous.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:19.30,0:07:25.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1146 0 l 1146 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:19.30,0:07:25.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
