Dialogue: 3,0:07:19.30,0:07:25.05,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}GEORGE WASHINGTON · MINIATURE BY JAMES PEALE, 1782
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.19,0:07:29.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Think about the choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.58,0:07:32.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}To protect his army from smallpox, he had to give
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.53,0:07:34.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}his soldiers smallpox. On purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.58,0:07:36.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}With a procedure that could still kill.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:28.44,0:07:34.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1146 0 l 1146 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:28.44,0:07:34.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:28.44,0:07:34.19,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}PORTRAIT · METROPOLITAN MUSEUM OF ART
Dialogue: 3,0:07:28.44,0:07:34.19,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}GEORGE WASHINGTON · PORTRAIT MINIATURE, C. 1776–83
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.66,0:07:54.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}To him, smallpox was more to dread than the sword of
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.79,0:07:55.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}the enemy.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:51.91,0:07:55.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1489 0 l 1489 132 l 0 132{\p0}
