Dialogue: 3,0:07:51.91,0:07:55.79,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}GEORGE WASHINGTON · THE ATHENAEUM PORTRAIT BY GILBERT STUART, 1796
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.84,0:07:59.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The Military Health System estimates that about 90%
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.61,0:08:03.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}of Continental Army deaths came from disease, not combat.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:56.09,0:08:01.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1767 0 l 1767 132 l 0 132{\p0}
