Dialogue: 3,0:07:56.09,0:08:01.84,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}WASHINGTON AND LAFAYETTE AT VALLEY FORGE · PAINTING BY JOHN WARD DUNSMORE, 1907
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.04,0:08:17.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Mount Vernon adds a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.24,0:08:20.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It is difficult to track smallpox deaths in the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.93,0:08:22.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Revolutionary War.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.35,0:08:25.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The epidemic lasted from 1775 to 1782.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:15.29,0:08:21.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1231 0 l 1231 132 l 0 132{\p0}
