Dialogue: 3,0:08:15.29,0:08:21.04,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}GEORGE WASHINGTON · FRAMED MEDALLION PORTRAIT, 1800–30
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.81,0:08:48.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Historians still weigh how much it changed the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.30,0:08:50.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The order itself is on the record.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.62,0:08:54.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It was an order about disease, in an army where, one
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.18,0:08:57.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}study suggests, illness killed far more men than the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.74,0:08:58.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}British.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:45.06,0:08:50.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1446 0 l 1446 132 l 0 132{\p0}
