Dialogue: 3,0:08:45.06,0:08:50.81,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}BROADSIDE · GENERIC EARLY-AMERICAN NOTICE
Dialogue: 3,0:08:45.06,0:08:50.81,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}NOTICE OF SMALLPOX INOCULATION · STURBRIDGE, MASSACHUSETTS, 1801
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.74,0:09:00.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}That order went after one disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.81,0:09:02.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It did nothing about the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.65,0:09:05.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And the next time America sent an army abroad, the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.70,0:09:06.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}pattern would repeat.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:58.99,0:09:04.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1746 0 l 1746 132 l 0 132{\p0}
