Dialogue: 3,0:08:58.99,0:09:04.74,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}AN INQUIRY INTO THE CAUSES AND EFFECTS OF THE VARIOLAE VACCINAE · LONDON, 1798
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.35,0:09:24.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}At Monterrey, American troops stormed a city that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.17,0:09:25.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}had been turned into a fortress.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:21.60,0:09:26.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1305 0 l 1305 132 l 0 132{\p0}
