Dialogue: 3,0:09:21.60,0:09:26.41,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}STORMING OF MONTEREY · 1846
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.46,0:09:30.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}At Veracruz, in March 1847, General Winfield Scott
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.49,0:09:32.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}laid siege to the port.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:26.71,0:09:32.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 982 0 l 982 132 l 0 132{\p0}
