Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.79,0:09:35.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Engravings of the day show Monterrey's Bishop's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.59,0:09:38.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Palace, one of the places the battle was fought for.
