Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.14,0:09:42.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Those are the battles in the history books. Buena Vista.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.67,0:09:43.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Chapultepec.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.42,0:09:44.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The fall of Mexico City.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:39.39,0:09:45.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 853 0 l 853 132 l 0 132{\p0}
