Dialogue: 3,0:09:39.39,0:09:45.14,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TAYLOR AT BUENA VISTA · 1847
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.38,0:09:47.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}So here is the other count.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.15,0:09:49.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The one nobody put on a monument.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:45.63,0:09:49.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 853 0 l 853 132 l 0 132{\p0}
