Dialogue: 3,0:09:45.63,0:09:49.71,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}CITY OF MEXICO · 1847
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.02,0:10:20.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Do the arithmetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.29,0:10:23.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}For every man who died in battle, close to seven
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.69,0:10:25.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}died some other way.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:19.27,0:10:25.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1403 0 l 1403 132 l 0 132{\p0}
