Dialogue: 3,0:10:19.27,0:10:25.02,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}PYRAMIDS OF SAN JUAN · MEXICO (ILLUSTRATION, NOT A CAMP SCENE)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.84,0:10:54.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}But even with that doubt, the shape is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.34,0:10:57.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In this war, an army lost far more men away from the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.22,0:10:58.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}fight than in it.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:52.09,0:10:57.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 853 0 l 853 132 l 0 132{\p0}
