Dialogue: 3,0:10:52.09,0:10:57.84,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}JALAPA · MEXICO, 1847
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.62,0:11:00.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Americans did not call it a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.85,0:11:02.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}They called it a victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.44,0:11:05.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}They went home, and the numbers went into a pension
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.68,0:11:06.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}report.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:58.87,0:11:04.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1305 0 l 1305 132 l 0 132{\p0}
