Dialogue: 3,0:10:58.87,0:11:04.62,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}GENERAL TAYLOR TAKING LEAVE OF THE SOLDIERS · 1847
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.58,0:11:09.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In 1861, the country would raise armies again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.71,0:11:10.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Far bigger ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.80,0:11:13.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And this time, someone would count everything.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:06.83,0:11:12.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1305 0 l 1305 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:11:06.83,0:11:12.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
