Dialogue: 3,0:11:06.83,0:11:12.58,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}PUEBLA · MEXICO, 1847
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.42,0:11:21.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In 1861, thousands of young men left small towns and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.01,0:11:23.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}farms to join the Union army.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.01,0:11:26.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}They gathered in camps outside Washington.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:18.67,0:11:24.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1031 0 l 1031 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:11:18.67,0:11:24.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
