Dialogue: 3,0:11:18.67,0:11:24.42,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}SECOND MAINE INFANTRY · CAMP JAMESON, 1861
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.36,0:11:30.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Camps sprang up on the hills around Washington.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.06,0:11:32.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Row on row of tents, and every man in them a
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.59,0:11:33.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}stranger to the next.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:27.61,0:11:33.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1274 0 l 1274 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:11:27.61,0:11:33.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
