Dialogue: 3,0:11:27.61,0:11:33.36,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}THE SEVENTEENTH NEW YORK · MINER'S HILL, NEAR WASHINGTON
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.24,0:11:37.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Many had never been exposed to the common childhood
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.48,0:11:39.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}diseases. Measles. Mumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.07,0:11:42.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The National Museum of Health and Medicine says
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.05,0:11:44.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}rural recruits like these often died of them.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:34.49,0:11:40.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1167 0 l 1167 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:11:34.49,0:11:40.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
