Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.81,0:15:08.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Surgeons asked for cleanliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.92,0:15:11.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Officers and soldiers largely ignored them.
