Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.59,0:15:35.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The Union army was, in a grim sense, the largest
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.70,0:15:38.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}experiment in camp life the country had ever run.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.88,0:15:41.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And its own doctors were taking notes.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:32.84,0:15:38.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1424 0 l 1424 132 l 0 132{\p0}
