Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.79,0:15:45.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Pneumonia, measles, mumps, dysentery, typhoid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.19,0:15:48.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A soldier of 1862 could survive the bullets of a
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.73,0:15:51.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}whole campaign and still never come home.
