Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.54,0:16:13.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It was a civilian organization.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.44,0:16:16.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Its job was to push the army to take care of its men.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.69,0:16:18.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Its general secretary was Olmsted.
