Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.68,0:16:46.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}What they found was often abject squalor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.14,0:16:49.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And the National Park Service notes that soldiers
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.08,0:16:50.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}disregarded the sanitary rules.
