Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.33,0:17:21.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It funded hospital trains and hospital ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.06,0:17:23.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It held sanitary fairs to raise money.
