Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.62,0:17:41.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It could argue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.74,0:17:42.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It could shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.86,0:17:46.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It could not always make a regiment dig a latrine in
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.73,0:17:47.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}the right place.
