Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.38,0:17:50.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Here is what makes the story strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.64,0:17:53.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The cause of camp fevers was still argued over, and
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.75,0:17:55.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}the proof was not yet in hand.
