Dialogue: 3,0:17:48.63,0:17:54.38,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}THE 114TH PENNSYLVANIA · BRANDY STATION, VA., WINTER OF 1863
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.29,0:18:17.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Cleaner camps may have helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.08,0:18:19.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}But cleaning without understanding is guesswork.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.94,0:18:22.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The proof would have to be built, case by case, in
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.92,0:18:24.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}someone's notebook.
