Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.69,0:19:13.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The idea they had to test was not new.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.32,0:19:16.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A Cuban physician, Carlos Finlay, had proposed in
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.70,0:19:19.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}1881 that a mosquito carried yellow fever.
