Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.66,0:19:47.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Carroll fell ill with yellow fever, and so did an
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.15,0:19:48.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Army private.
