Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.17,0:19:59.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The University of Virginia's exhibit says his death
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.39,0:20:02.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}was very likely from an experimental infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.36,0:20:05.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The camp the commission built that winter carried
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.45,0:20:06.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}his name.
