Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.95,0:20:54.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Other volunteers lived in a building full of
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.79,0:20:57.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}infected clothing, to test whether the sickness
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.83,0:21:00.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}passed from person to person through cloth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.62,0:21:03.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}7 men took part in three 20-day trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.14,0:21:04.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}None caught it.
