Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.31,0:22:17.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}By January 1903, a report said Cuba was free of
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.00,0:22:19.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}yellow fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.02,0:22:23.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Decades later, mosquito control still looked like this:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.35,0:22:27.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}a Public Health Service film from Tampa, Florida, 1945.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:14.56,0:22:20.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 998 0 l 998 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:22:14.56,0:22:20.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:22:14.56,0:22:20.31,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}LATER MOSQUITO CONTROL · TAMPA, FLORIDA · NOT HAVANA, 1900
Dialogue: 3,0:22:14.56,0:22:20.31,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}1945 PUBLIC HEALTH SERVICE FILM
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.12,0:22:29.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The work was patient and plain.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.88,0:22:32.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Inspectors lifted covers, tipped out buckets, and
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.68,0:22:35.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}looked for standing water where the mosquito could
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.52,0:22:36.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}lay eggs.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:28.37,0:22:34.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 998 0 l 998 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:22:28.37,0:22:34.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:22:28.37,0:22:34.12,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}LATER MOSQUITO CONTROL · TAMPA, FLORIDA · NOT HAVANA, 1900
Dialogue: 3,0:22:28.37,0:22:34.12,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}1945 PUBLIC HEALTH SERVICE FILM
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.49,0:22:39.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}This is the mosquito itself, Aedes aegypti, in a
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.38,0:22:41.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}training film made for the same service.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.79,0:22:44.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The larvae live in the water we leave behind.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:36.74,0:22:42.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1015 0 l 1015 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:22:36.74,0:22:42.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:22:36.74,0:22:42.49,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}THE AEDES AEGYPTI MOSQUITO · LATER FOOTAGE · NOT CUBA, 1900
Dialogue: 3,0:22:36.74,0:22:42.49,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}1945 PUBLIC HEALTH SERVICE TRAINING FILM
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.44,0:22:56.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The mosquito was one enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.29,0:22:59.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}But in the camps of 1898, another killer moved
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.45,0:23:01.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}through hands, water and flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.58,0:23:05.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The Army was about to try a different weapon: a shot.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:54.69,0:23:00.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1015 0 l 1015 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:22:54.69,0:23:00.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:22:54.69,0:23:00.44,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}THE AEDES AEGYPTI MOSQUITO · LATER FOOTAGE · NOT CUBA, 1900
Dialogue: 3,0:22:54.69,0:23:00.44,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}1945 PUBLIC HEALTH SERVICE TRAINING FILM
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.01,0:23:24.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}An Army board went through the records of 92
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.82,0:23:26.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}regiments to learn how it spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.93,0:23:29.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Its report ran to nearly 3,000 manuscript pages.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.99,0:23:33.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It was written by Reed, Vaughan and Shakespeare.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:22.26,0:23:28.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1167 0 l 1167 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:23:22.26,0:23:28.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:23:22.26,0:23:28.01,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}PLATE · TYPHOID BOARD REPORT, VOL. 2 (1904)
Dialogue: 3,0:23:22.26,0:23:28.01,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TYPHOID CASES BY DAY IN AN ARMY CORPS' CAMPS · 1898
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.87,0:24:05.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The museum calls the 1909 effort the Army's first
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.31,0:24:08.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}large-scale typhoid vaccination program.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.11,0:24:11.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The vaccine was still new, and the choice was still
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.69,0:24:12.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}voluntary.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:02.12,0:24:07.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1192 0 l 1192 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:24:02.12,0:24:07.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:24:02.12,0:24:07.87,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}PHOTO · MEDICAL DEPT. OF THE U.S. ARMY IN THE WORLD WAR, VOL. 6 (1926)
Dialogue: 3,0:24:02.12,0:24:07.87,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TABLE SERVICE · CAMP GRANT, ILLINOIS · 1918
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.84,0:24:16.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In early 1911, it became required for troops sent to
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.18,0:24:17.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}the southern border.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.46,0:24:20.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Later that year, it became mandatory for everyone in
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.80,0:24:21.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}the service.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:13.09,0:24:18.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1188 0 l 1188 132 l 0 132{\p0}
