Dialogue: 3,0:24:13.09,0:24:18.84,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}GENERIC · DISCUSSES THE U.S. ARMY'S TYPHOID RECORD
Dialogue: 3,0:24:13.09,0:24:18.84,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}"ANTI-TYPHOID VACCINATION" · PAMPHLET · LONDON, 1915
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.72,0:24:41.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The 1898 division recorded 2,693 cases and 248 deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.95,0:24:46.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The vaccinated division had one case, and no deaths.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:36.97,0:24:42.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1146 0 l 1146 132 l 0 132{\p0}
