Dialogue: 3,0:24:36.97,0:24:42.72,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TYPHOID INOCULATION · CAMP SHERMAN, OHIO · 1917–18
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.07,0:25:03.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Among 4,087 vaccinated men, 55 fell ill and four died.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.75,0:25:08.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Among 812 who were not vaccinated, 45 fell ill and
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.00,0:25:10.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}seven died.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:58.32,0:25:04.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1146 0 l 1146 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:24:58.32,0:25:04.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:24:58.32,0:25:04.07,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}U.S. ARMY SIGNAL CORPS FILM · NARA
Dialogue: 3,0:24:58.32,0:25:04.07,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TYPHOID INOCULATION · CAMP SHERMAN, OHIO · 1917–18
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.66,0:25:25.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In the Spanish-American War, the rate had been
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.56,0:25:27.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}141.59 per thousand a year.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:21.91,0:25:27.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 870 0 l 870 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:25:21.91,0:25:27.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:25:21.91,0:25:27.66,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}U.S. ARMY SIGNAL CORPS FILM · 83RD DIVISION · NARA
Dialogue: 3,0:25:21.91,0:25:27.66,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}CAMP SHERMAN, OHIO · 1917–18
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.74,0:25:55.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The shot was not the only defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.06,0:25:58.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The camps of 1918 also purified their water, which
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.49,0:26:01.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}is what you see here, and kept flies away from food
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.98,0:26:02.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}and garbage.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:52.99,0:25:58.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1617 0 l 1617 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:25:52.99,0:25:58.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:25:52.99,0:25:58.74,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}PHOTO · MEDICAL DEPT. OF THE U.S. ARMY IN THE WORLD WAR, VOL. 6 (1926)
Dialogue: 3,0:25:52.99,0:25:58.74,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}SPECIAL EQUIPMENT · CAMP MEADE WATER-PURIFICATION PLANT, MARYLAND · 1918
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.25,0:26:05.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Here is the filter room of the same plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.72,0:26:08.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Clean water, closed garbage cans, and a needle in
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.61,0:26:10.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}the arm all worked at once.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:03.50,0:26:09.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1489 0 l 1489 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:26:03.50,0:26:09.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:26:03.50,0:26:09.25,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}PHOTO · MEDICAL DEPT. OF THE U.S. ARMY IN THE WORLD WAR, VOL. 6 (1926)
Dialogue: 3,0:26:03.50,0:26:09.25,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}FILTER ROOM · CAMP MEADE WATER-PURIFICATION PLANT, MARYLAND · 1918
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.65,0:26:12.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}An association is not a cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.63,0:26:16.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}But across these records, the line goes in one direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.38,0:26:19.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Where soldiers were vaccinated, typhoid fell.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:10.90,0:26:16.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1617 0 l 1617 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:26:10.90,0:26:16.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:26:10.90,0:26:16.65,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}PHOTO · MEDICAL DEPT. OF THE U.S. ARMY IN THE WORLD WAR, VOL. 6 (1926)
Dialogue: 3,0:26:10.90,0:26:16.65,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ONE METHOD OF PROTECTING GARBAGE CANS FROM FLIES · U.S. ARMY CAMP · 1918
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.79,0:26:23.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A typhoid shot was routine at Camp Sherman, Ohio.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.20,0:26:26.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}An intertitle in its Signal Corps film reads:
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.32,0:26:29.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Inoculation prevents typhoid fever and other serious
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.93,0:26:30.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}diseases.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:20.04,0:26:25.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1146 0 l 1146 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:26:20.04,0:26:25.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:26:20.04,0:26:25.79,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}U.S. ARMY SIGNAL CORPS FILM · NARA
Dialogue: 3,0:26:20.04,0:26:25.79,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TYPHOID INOCULATION · CAMP SHERMAN, OHIO · 1917–18
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.00,0:26:34.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}But in 1918, a different disease was about to reach
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.34,0:26:37.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}the camps, one that no shot of that day could stop.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:31.25,0:26:37.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 870 0 l 870 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:26:31.25,0:26:37.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:26:31.25,0:26:37.00,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}U.S. ARMY SIGNAL CORPS FILM · 83RD DIVISION · NARA
Dialogue: 3,0:26:31.25,0:26:37.00,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}CAMP SHERMAN, OHIO · 1917–18
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.28,0:26:58.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Camps like this gathered tens of thousands of men in
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.62,0:26:59.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.27,0:27:02.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}This is Camp Sherman, in Ohio, a different camp, in
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.55,0:27:03.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}the same war.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.38,0:27:04.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Funston was 56,000 men.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:55.53,0:27:01.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 870 0 l 870 132 l 0 132{\p0}
