Dialogue: 3,0:26:55.53,0:27:01.28,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}CAMP SHERMAN, OHIO · 1917–18
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.31,0:27:07.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Men ate, slept, drilled and lined up together, by
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.89,0:27:08.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}the thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.57,0:27:11.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Every one of them would soon be sent somewhere.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:05.56,0:27:11.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1210 0 l 1210 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:27:05.56,0:27:11.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
