Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.41,0:37:41.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}What we can say is narrower.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.32,0:37:44.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A powder, a plan, and tens of thousands of people
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.67,0:37:45.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}lining up each day.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.97,0:37:48.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}By late February, the alarm was over.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:39.66,0:37:45.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1144 0 l 1144 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:37:39.66,0:37:45.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:37:39.66,0:37:45.41,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}U.S. ARMY FILM BULLETIN 195 · DDT: WEAPON AGAINST DISEASE · 1944–45
Dialogue: 3,0:37:39.66,0:37:45.41,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}LOUSE-POWDER DUSTING · NAPLES, WINTER 1943–44
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.94,0:37:52.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Those old lessons, water, waste, insects and shots,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.70,0:37:54.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}did not stay in the 1940s.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.61,0:37:57.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}So what does the military do now?
Dialogue: 2,0:37:49.19,0:37:54.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 845 0 l 845 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:37:49.19,0:37:54.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:37:49.19,0:37:54.94,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}MCAS IWAKUNI, JAPAN · OCT. 2, 2026 · DVIDS VIDEO
Dialogue: 3,0:37:49.19,0:37:54.94,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TODAY: FLU VACCINATION · NAVY CLINIC
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.92,0:39:16.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Start with water.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.20,0:39:20.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}An Army film from 1944 shows a purification station:
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.11,0:39:23.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}barrels, a canvas bag, and a soldier drinking from
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.87,0:39:24.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}his canteen.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:15.17,0:39:20.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1482 0 l 1482 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:39:15.17,0:39:20.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:39:15.17,0:39:20.92,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}U.S. ARMY FILM BULLETIN 147 · MEDICAL SERVICE IN THE JUNGLE · 1944 · LOCATION NOT STATED
Dialogue: 3,0:39:15.17,0:39:20.92,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}WATER PURIFICATION STATION
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.22,0:39:27.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Insect control came home, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.30,0:39:30.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A Public Health Service training film from 1945
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.57,0:39:34.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}shows the larvae of Aedes aegypti, the mosquito that
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.19,0:39:36.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}carries yellow fever and dengue.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:25.47,0:39:31.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1296 0 l 1296 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:39:25.47,0:39:31.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:39:25.47,0:39:31.22,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}U.S. PUBLIC HEALTH SERVICE · NLM COPY
Dialogue: 3,0:39:25.47,0:39:31.22,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}AEDES AEGYPTI LARVAE AND PUPAE · PHS TRAINING FILM · 1945
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.87,0:39:40.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The Army's World War I sanitation volume shows crews
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.76,0:39:44.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}oiling small pools with knapsack sprayers at Camp
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.43,0:39:46.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Meade, Maryland, in 1918.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:37.12,0:39:42.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1489 0 l 1489 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:39:37.12,0:39:42.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:39:37.12,0:39:42.87,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARMY MEDICAL DEPT. IN THE WORLD WAR, VOL. 6 'SANITATION' (1926)
Dialogue: 3,0:39:37.12,0:39:42.87,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}OILING SMALL POOLS WITH KNAPSACK SPRAYERS · CAMP MEADE, MD. · 1918
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.57,0:39:57.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The Army's article adds that the CDC recommends a
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.95,0:40:01.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}yearly flu vaccine for people older than 6 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.41,0:40:04.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}That is the Army quoting the CDC, not us.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:54.82,0:40:00.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1317 0 l 1317 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:39:54.82,0:40:00.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:39:54.82,0:40:00.57,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}U.S. WAR DEPT. FILM BULLETIN 217 · NLM COPY
Dialogue: 3,0:39:54.82,0:40:00.57,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}VACCINE PRODUCTION · ARMY MEDICAL LABORATORIES FILM · 1947
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.69,0:40:08.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}On October 2, 2026, at Marine Corps Air Station
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.62,0:40:13.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Iwakuni, in Japan, a Navy clinic ran flu vaccinations.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:04.94,0:40:10.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 845 0 l 845 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:40:04.94,0:40:10.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
