Dialogue: 3,0:40:04.94,0:40:10.69,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TODAY: FLU VACCINATION · NAVY CLINIC
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.59,0:40:16.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}At Ramstein, in Germany, an immunizations clinic
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.64,0:40:17.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}does one job:
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.46,0:40:20.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}the paperwork, the vial, the needle, and then the
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.57,0:40:21.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}next person in line.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:13.84,0:40:19.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 652 0 l 652 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:40:13.84,0:40:19.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:40:13.84,0:40:19.59,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}RAMSTEIN, GERMANY · DVIDS VIDEO
Dialogue: 3,0:40:13.84,0:40:19.59,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TODAY: IMMUNIZATIONS CLINIC
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.30,0:40:25.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}On October 26, at Camp Carroll, in South Korea, a
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.69,0:40:28.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}flu drive filled a large hall with soldiers and
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.94,0:40:31.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}staff, and a line of sleeves rolled up.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:22.55,0:40:28.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 950 0 l 950 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:40:22.55,0:40:28.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:40:22.55,0:40:28.30,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}CAMP CARROLL, SOUTH KOREA · OCT. 26, 2026 · DVIDS VIDEO
Dialogue: 3,0:40:22.55,0:40:28.30,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TODAY: FLU DRIVE
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.09,0:40:33.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The camps are different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.82,0:40:36.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The enemy, in the end, is older than any army.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:32.34,0:40:37.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 950 0 l 950 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:40:32.34,0:40:37.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:40:32.34,0:40:37.05,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}CAMP CARROLL, SOUTH KOREA · OCT. 26, 2026 · DVIDS VIDEO
Dialogue: 3,0:40:32.34,0:40:37.05,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TODAY: FLU DRIVE
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.17,0:41:35.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Non-battle includes accidents, so it is not a pure
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.50,0:41:36.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}count of disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.64,0:41:39.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}But in the camps of these wars, the records keep
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.83,0:41:41.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}pointing at the same things:
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.70,0:41:44.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}crowding, filthy water, and insects.
Dialogue: 2,0:41:32.42,0:41:38.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1482 0 l 1482 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:41:32.42,0:41:38.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:41:32.42,0:41:38.17,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}U.S. ARMY FILM BULLETIN 147 · MEDICAL SERVICE IN THE JUNGLE · 1944 · LOCATION NOT STATED
Dialogue: 3,0:41:32.42,0:41:38.17,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}WATER PURIFICATION STATION
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.63,0:42:01.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The change was not magic, and the records do not say
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.88,0:42:03.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}how much each piece mattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.70,0:42:06.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Survey units, clean water, drained ponds, powders,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.82,0:42:09.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}vaccines, and people willing to count and enforce
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.88,0:42:11.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}were all part of it.
Dialogue: 2,0:41:58.88,0:42:04.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 652 0 l 652 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:41:58.88,0:42:04.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:41:58.88,0:42:04.63,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}RAMSTEIN, GERMANY · DVIDS VIDEO
Dialogue: 3,0:41:58.88,0:42:04.63,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TODAY: IMMUNIZATIONS CLINIC
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.58,0:42:14.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Disease is a quieter enemy than a rifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.10,0:42:16.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It never stopped being an enemy.
Dialogue: 2,0:42:11.83,0:42:16.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 845 0 l 845 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:42:11.83,0:42:16.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
